  "description": {
    "ja": {
      "source": "Wikipedia 日本語版「クズウコン」",
      "source_url": "https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E3%82%AF%E3%82%BA%E3%82%A6%E3%82%B3%E3%83%B3",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-09",
      "revision": 110085582,
      "text": "クズウコン は、熱帯アメリカ原産のクズウコン科クズウコン属の多年草。地下茎から澱粉を採るために熱帯各地で栽培される。中国名は、竹芋。"
    },
    "en": {
      "source": "Wikipedia 英語版「Maranta arundinacea」",
      "source_url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Maranta_arundinacea",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-09",
      "revision": 1352699193,
      "text": "Maranta arundinacea, also known as arrowroot, maranta, West Indian arrowroot, obedience plant or Bermuda arrowroot is a large, perennial herb found in rainforest habitats of the Americas, but cultivated in tropical regions worldwide."
    }
